| grep '^pub mod') <(printf 'pub mod enrich;\npub mod indices;\npub mod pipeline;\n')` expect no output; `diff <(grep -A1 'cfg(feature = "cli")' /Users/gabe/Projects/monokl/crates/monokl/src/lib.rs | grep '^pub mod') <(printf 'pub mod cli;\npub mod output;\n')` expect no output; and cross-check the source's own summary sentence verbatim: `grep -c '^Modules gated on .lang-ts.: .enrich., .indices., .pipeline.\. Modules gated on .cli.: .cli., .output.\. Everything else is always compiled\.$' /Users/gabe/Projects/monokl/docs/spec/01-core-architecture.md` expect `1`.
